    <dashboard enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='3 - Recommendations &amp; Impact'>
      <style />
      <size maxheight='750' maxwidth='1200' minheight='750' minwidth='1200' preset-index='2' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='46000' id='3' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='33583' x='65750' y='13600'>
            <zone h='46000' id='7' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='33583' x='65750' y='13600'>
              <zone h='46000' id='8' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='33583' x='65750' y='13600'>
                <zone fixed-size='395' forceUpdate='true' h='46000' id='12' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='33583' x='65750' y='13600'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='15' underline='true'>EMPLOYMENT HISTORY &amp; DEFAULT RISK</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='14'>WHAT WE FOUND:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12' italic='true'>Borrowers with shorter employment histories generally have higher default rates than borrowers with longer employment histories in similar loan-to-income groups.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='14'>RECOMMENDED ACTION:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12' italic='true'>Consider employment history alongside income and loan size when reviewing a borrower&apos;s ability to repay. Do not rely on employment history alone.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#444444' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#444444' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='background-color' value='#f7faf0' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone h='12533' id='5' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98666' x='667' y='1067'>
            <zone forceUpdate='true' h='12533' id='6' type-v2='text' w='98666' x='667' y='1067'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run fontcolor='#005493' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='20'>RECOMMENDATIONS &amp; BUSINESS IMPACT </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#005493' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='20'>Practical actions based on observed default patterns</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#444444' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='39333' id='9' type-v2='text' w='98666' x='667' y='59600'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='18' underline='true'>BUSINESS IMPACT &amp; LIMITATIONS</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'>POTENTIAL BUSINESS BENEFITS:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12' italic='true'>• Focus review efforts on borrower groups that account for more defaults.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12' italic='true'>• Identify loans that may need closer repayment checks.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12' italic='true'>• Track future default rates to assess whether changes are helping.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='15'>LIMITATIONS:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12' italic='true'>• The analysis shows patterns, not proof of what causes defaults.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12' italic='true'>• Some missing employment data was filled in during data cleaning.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12' italic='true'>• Results for small groups should be treated cautiously.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12' italic='true'>• Actual financial savings and reductions in defaults have not been measured.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#444444' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='2' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              <format attr='background-color' value='#f5eddc' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='46000' id='10' type-v2='text' w='31416' x='667' y='13600'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='15' underline='true'>LOAN-TO-INCOME RISK ASSESSMENT</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='14'>WHAT WE FOUND:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12' italic='true'>Loans where the loan amount is at least 30% of annual income represent 13.16% of all loans but account for 39.47% of defaults</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' italic='true'>.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='14'>RECOMMENDED ACTION:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12' italic='true'>Review borrowers&apos; ability to repay, especially when the loan amount is high relative to their annual income</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#444444' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='dotted' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              <format attr='background-color' value='#ddebf0' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='46000' id='11' type-v2='text' w='33667' x='32083' y='13600'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='15' underline='true'>LOAN PURPOSE RISK ANALYSIS</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='14'>WHAT WE FOUND:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12' italic='true'>Debt Consolidation has the highest default rate at 28.68%. Medical loans account for the largest number of defaults, at 1,617.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='14'>RECOMMENDED ACTION:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12' italic='true'>Investigate why defaults are common in these two loan categories and identify where additional checks may help.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#444444' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              <format attr='background-color' value='#f9e9e0' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#444444' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
